7. Alternatives to AWS for the ICVSP data pipeline

8. AWS monthly cost estimate — all services

Cost notes: $143.28/month is a planning estimate, not a fully verified AWS quote. S3 ($11.59) and Glue Spark ETL ($52.80) are the recorded AWS Pricing Calculator results; the remaining items are planning allowances. Lambda is $0 only if eligible Free Tier remains (about $0.17/month without it). Crawler/Data Quality may overlap with Spark runtime if run inside the same job. QuickSight’s $54 is provisional and depends on edition/user type. Taxes, data transfer out, support and backups are excluded; one-time S3 PUT ($0.16) is excluded.

Recommended flow: Supabase (operational source of truth) → selected export / webhook / CDC → S3 (analytics copy) → Glue (ETL) → Athena (SQL analysis) → QuickSight (dashboards). Lambda, EventBridge Scheduler and Step Functions can automate jobs.

